# Reanimate puts the Sell-Sword onto the battlefield under Bot1's control after Bot1 bolted it the same turn (its own death, under Bot1's control, is in the
# turn's history): it enters with one counter, a 3/3 (CR 614.1c, 700.4). Bot1 loses 2 life (its mana value).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Callous Sell-Sword
Lightning Bolt
Reanimate
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Callous Sell-Sword.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Callous Sell-Sword)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Callous Sell-Sword)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Callous Sell-Sword.Power = 3
